{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 22, "text": "在摩教中，报陆陀首先是一个造物主，并且常常和摩陆高并提。布摩在举行“殡亡”、", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1480, "w": 1472, "h": 73}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在摩教中，报陆陀首先是一个造物主，并且常常和摩陆高并提。布摩在举行“殡亡”、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1480, "w": 1472, "h": 73}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 23, "text": "“赎头”、扫寨、送鬼等大型仪式活动前均要举行“安师”仪式，就是专门请报陆陀、摩陆高", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1549, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“赎头”、扫寨、送鬼等大型仪式活动前均要举行“安师”仪式，就是专门请报陆陀、摩陆高", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1549, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 24, "text": "前来坐镇，保佑布摩和主人家的。祷词曰：", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1621, "w": 732, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "前来坐镇，保佑布摩和主人家的。祷词曰：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1621, "w": 732, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 25, "text": "请你报陆陀、摩陆高，", "bbox_px": {"x": 438, "y": 1686, "w": 374, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "请你报陆陀、摩陆高，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 438, "y": 1686, "w": 374, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 26, "text": "并陆高、陆元、陆丁、陆林、陆逢、陆贵：①", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1746, "w": 687, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "并陆高、陆元、陆丁、陆林、陆逢、陆贵：①", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1746, "w": 687, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 27, "text": "林中树木是他造，", "bbox_px": {"x": 438, "y": 1810, "w": 314, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "林中树木是他造，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 438, "y": 1810, "w": 314, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 28, "text": "宇宙万物是他造，", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1879, "w": 306, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "宇宙万物是他造，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1879, "w": 306, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 29, "text": "山川河流是他造。", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1947, "w": 310, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "山川河流是他造。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1947, "w": 310, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 30, "text": "请他来做上席当尊者，", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 2008, "w": 390, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请他来做上席当尊者，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 2008, "w": 390, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 133, "line_no": 31, "text": "请他来保护布摩，", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 2070, "w": 310, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请他来保护布摩，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 2070, "w": 310, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
